# A flip that subtracts the old member twice leaves its slot outside the
# count domain.
MODULE: TypeOKSlotUnderflow
TARGET: TypeOK
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: an ordinary flip retracts the prior member twice, driving a slot count negative
PERTURBS: Flip

--- FIND
                       /\ slots' = Add(Retract(slots, old), new)
--- REPLACE
                       /\ slots' = Add(Retract(Retract(slots, old), old), new)
--- END
